.TH vmexec-completions 1  "completions " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
vmexec\-completions \- Generate completion file for a shell
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBvmexec completions\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISHELL\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Generate completion file for a shell
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISHELL\fR>

